+	/*
+	 * Stops at 960MHz, which is where the bootloader leaves all four cores
+	 * (krait-cc reports "CPU0 @ 960000 KHz" at probe). Nothing in mainline
+	 * can drive VDD_APC, so the table may not ask for a rate needing more
+	 * voltage than the rail already supplies: downstream's
+	 * qcom,speed2-pvs4-bin-v0 wants 820000uV at 960MHz and this device has
+	 * booted at that rate, so everything here is covered. The rest of the
+	 * ladder up to 2.15GHz goes in once the rail is controllable.
+	 */
+	cpu_opp_table: opp-table-cpu {
